# Working notes at the repo root: findings, reports and plans are scratch, not
# deliverables. Ignore root-level Markdown by default and whitelist the docs
# that are genuinely part of the repo, so a new note cannot be committed by a
# stray `git add -A`. Only affects the root; nested *.md is untouched.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/README_en.md
!/README_zh.md
!/design-qa.md
